		agencies, or companies are for identification and do not imply endorsement.
	</p>

	<h2 id="third-parties">Third-party links and advertising</h2>
	<p>
		The site may link to third-party websites and may display advertising. We do not control
		those sites or ads and are not responsible for their content, products, privacy
		practices, or accuracy. A link or ad does not mean we endorse the third party. Review the
		third party's terms and privacy policy before using it.
	</p>

