	<p>
		Questions about these terms can be sent to{' '}
		<a href="mailto:hello@nethourly.com">hello@nethourly.com</a>. Include “Terms” in the
		subject line. For a correction, include the page URL and the figure you believe is wrong.
	</p>
</LegalPage>
